categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"vloE7oh2OzOYGvZSt6aVFQ","review_id":"wvwr88ndny6hOZL0TVejhw","date":"2019-03-31T20:53:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9172333478927612,"text_excerpt":"PJ's is a great local spot for coffee in the French Quarter. Staff is always friendly and helpful and the place is clean and bright (as clean as can be expected given that it's the quarter )."},{"business_id":"vloE7oh2OzOYGvZSt6aVFQ","review_id":"nPRXUaRbQbzDd6D444Xlnw","date":"2018-04-27T17:02:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.910183310508728,"text_excerpt":"This is the PJ's near a Jackson Square. The coffee and baristas are amazing and fantastic. This is a quiet location and is great for working or relaxation. I appreciate the location being in the heart of the Quarter and close to the major attractions and a stone's throw from St. Louis Cathedral. Stop in for a grab and go, or linger for a few minutes or an hour or so to wind down from business and touring. You'll love PJ's it's locally owned so the money stays here in Louisiana. Just as good as the national chain in quality."},{"business_id":"vloE7oh2OzOYGvZSt6aVFQ","review_id":"yWO5M8B30zfx4y2Ltj-YMA","date":"2019-08-16T18:28:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.908439576625824,"text_excerpt":"I came in this morning after an abysmal Cafe Du Monde experience and they were awesome. They fixed me a pralines and cream latte with soy milk and were nice and attentive. While I was there I met a woman who was nice and we chatted for over an hour and no one said anything about wanting the table. This is an awesome place with good coffee and nice peeps."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vloE7oh2OzOYGvZSt6aVFQ","photo_id":"1BQQBC0NQP0GMUaP5WmWAQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/1BQQBC0NQP0GMUaP5WmWAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9122345447540283},{"business_id":"vloE7oh2OzOYGvZSt6aVFQ","photo_id":"D2DJ9DyaQt_NEhe-c83G9Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/D2DJ9DyaQt_NEhe-c83G9